@startuml
title 13. Generate content — duplicate request (dedup)
autonumber
participant Client
participant Gateway
participant Content
database ContentDB
database Redis

Client -> Gateway : POST /content/generate { poiId, mode } (2nd time)
Gateway -> Content : forward
Content -> ContentDB : find (poiId, mode)
ContentDB --> Content : none yet
Content -> Redis : SET status=PROCESSING (NX)
Redis --> Content : NOT set (already PROCESSING)
Content --> Client : 202 { status: PROCESSING }
note over Content,Redis : SET NX guarantees a single\nin-flight generation per (poiId, mode).\nNo duplicate task enqueued.
@enduml
